<title>UK: Reuters 11th UK-Asia/M.East aircargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 11th UK-Asia/M.East aircargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK to Asia/Australasia/Middle East GBP air cargo market rates per kg for 100kg and 1,000 kg/one tonne shipments, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>The per kg/1,000 kg average rates are published by Reuters in table format for the first time and so no comparisons are available.</p>
<p>		     100 kg		   1,000 kg</p>
<p>	     Aug 15	July 14	   Aug 15</p>
<p>			     NORTH ASIA</p>
<p>LON-HKG     1.10	   1.04	     0.95</p>
<p>LON-TOY     1.80	   1.80	     1.52</p>
<p>LON-PEK     1.39	   1.50	     1.20</p>
<p>LON-SEL     1.55	   1.58	     1.43</p>
<p>LON-SHA     1.56	   1.62	     1.46</p>
<p>LON-TPE     1.22	   1.21	     1.08</p>
<p>		 SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALASIA</p>
<p>LON-AKL     2.03	   1.95	     1.85</p>
<p>LON-BKK     1.11	   1.08	     0.97</p>
<p>LON-JAK     1.12	   1.16	     1.00</p>
<p>LON-KUL     1.10	   1.04	     0.95</p>
<p>LON-MNL     1.32	   1.30	     1.03</p>
<p>LON-SIN     1.08	   1.00	     0.95</p>
<p>LON-SYD     1.89	   1.85	     1.76</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST/SOUTH ASIA</p>
<p>LON-BAH     0.91	   0.90	     0.78</p>
<p>LON-DXB     0.66	   0.66	     0.55</p>
<p>LON-BOM     0.83	   0.78	     0.70</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and small cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel +44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
<p>-www.racs.com</p>
